    "body": "Releasing claim (blocked by build environment, no code pushed).\n\nWhat was checked on `upstream/main` (`31f8d03d`):\n- Baseline on Linux: `multi_pass_contour_simulates_with_meridian_parity` took `182.45s` in debug (`>60s`), and passed in `--release` in `44.88s` (`multi-pass contour: meridian parity over 438976 cell centres (174372 cut): 0 sign misses, worst |law| at a miss 0.000e0`).\n- Local test of the heavy-lane `#[ignore]` approach (`#[ignore]` on `multi_pass_contour_simulates_with_meridian_parity` in `crates/app/tests/lathe_field_sim.rs`, keeping assertions intact, plus pinning test `heavy_tests::lathe_field_sim_multi_pass_is_in_the_heavy_lane` in `xtask/src/heavy_tests.rs`):\n  - Pin failed before the edit, passed after (`0.22s`), and failed/passed on mutation check.\n  - `gate release --dry-run` listed `[94] app heavy: lathe_field_sim` (`cargo test --release -j 6 -p camcraft-app --no-fail-fast --test lathe_field_sim -- --test-threads=6 --ignored`).\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed (`wall 2.2 min, 2 step(s), 0 failed`): `lathe_field_sim` ran `5 passed; 0 failed; 1 ignored` in `99.41s` (note: slow output also flagged `a_grooving_blade_cuts_its_rectangle_and_the_verdict_refuses_the_lathe (>60s)` and `profile_rough_and_finish_simulate_with_meridian_parity (>60s)`); `xtask` unit tests passed (`138` + `3` + `3`).\n\nWhy this run stopped before completing Step 7 / opening a PR:\n- Subsequent `cargo` runs — specifically `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` (tried repeatedly, including just now with `BypassSandbox: true`) — exited `101` before compiling:\n  `sccache: error: Server startup failed: cache storage failed to read: Unexpected (temporary) at read => send http request`\n  `url: http://192.168.50.11:9000/.sccache_check`\n  `error sending request for url (http://192.168.50.11:9000/.sccache_check): client error (Connect): tcp connect error: Network unreachable (os error 101)`\n- Unable to run the required `cargo clippy` check and post-edit `gate test` under the runner environment.\n\nLocal worktree `.claude/worktrees/issue-1855` and unpushed local branch `issue/1855-lathe-field-sim-runtime` have been removed; no branch was pushed.\n",
